window.products.push({"id":956054,"name":"Electric Can Opener, Restaurant Can Opener, Smooth Edge Automatic Can Opener for Any Size, Best Kitchen Gadget for Chefs, Arthritis and Seniors (Slive","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qf3tRYTfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"With just one touch, this amazing electric can opener automatically opens your can in seconds! ☺Can opener is a must-have kitchen tool for every family. A reliable electric can opener will ensure a good job for you every time you open a can. ☺Electric can openers are completely different in design from traditional can openers.Open tank cover by internal pressure, intelligent and safe.This ensures that the lid and container are intact and that the remaining containers are properly stored. Battery installation: ➩STEP 1: Hold top of unit with left hand,thumb on top,fingers on the bottom and using the right hand,place thumb and index fingers on indentations of rubber grip. ➩STEP 2: Squeeze with thumb and index finger and pull backward in one strong, sharp movement. ➩STEP 3: Rotate rubber grip upward to access battery compartment. ➩STEP 4: Lower the rubber grip and push back into original position. Method of application : ①Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel. ②With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can. ③When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter. ④Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can. Specification: ❖ Size:5×2.7×1.4inch ❖ Colour:White ❖ Operate voltage:DC2.4-3V ❖Battery:2×AA alkaline or rechargeable batteries (not included) ❖ Can cutting size:diameter 52mm-153mm ❖ Maximum can cutting size in one cycle:diameter 98mm Package Contains: ✯1*Electric Can Opener ✯1*Product specification","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qf3tRYTfL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GWolffy","source_asin":"B09NNFZYPR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NNFZYPR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NNFZYPR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
