window.products.push({"id":956082,"name":"Tezzorio Stainless Steel Oval Platter, 18 x 12-Inch Serving Platter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kX4x3MqcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Oval Platter is an excellent idea to enhance a wonderfully prepared meal at home.It also fits in perfectly for any occasion and is ideal for crowd-sized entertaining. Crafted from durable stainless steel this platter is made to last through multiple services, while its mirror-polished finish adds an upscale shine for an attractive appearance! If you are looking to add an elegant touch to your diners' experience, you should consider using this platter. Oval platter is an excellent way to stylishly display any lavishly-prepared food, from a majestic Thanksgiving turkey to delicately-prepared desserts. If food presentation is crucial to the way your business is running or you simply want to enhance a wonderfully-prepared meal at home this is the tray you are looking for. Perfect for displaying and presenting an assortment of appetizers, finger foods, cheeses, and other hors-d'oeuvres, this platter is a versatile accessory for any catered event, buffet, or restaurant! Use for a bread platter, too or at home or your next party! Featuring a contoured oval shape this platter is designed for an easy-grip, making it convenient for your wait staff or caterers to carry and transport. An oval shape also gives this platter a modern edge and the elongated shape puts more emphasis on the food being served. Easy to clean, this platter is a necessity for your next gathering!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kX4x3MqcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tezzorio","source_asin":"B0746TFGR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0746TFGR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0746TFGR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":956083,"name":"ALDKitchen Rotating Waffle Maker | Flower-Shape Waffles | Belgian Waffle Iron | Stainless Steel | 110V (Petals)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oDHbvXAJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✪ COMMERCIAL USE: This electric Belgian Waffle iron with the rotating mechanism makes one round-shaped Belgian Waffle with petals pattern. The machine is equipped with a manual temperature control system and a timer. The power is 1.2kW. The rotating mechanism ensures that the waffles are heated evenly from up and down, obtaining a uniform and beautiful golden-brown color. It takes a few minutes to cook one big nutritive waffle with a diameter 7.25\" (184 mm) ✪ HIGH QUALITY: This Belgian Waffle maker is produced of 201 Stainless steel that ensures the long service life of the appliance. Stainless steel is known for its rust resistance and durability, which is important for professional kitchen equipment. The machine requires a minimum of effort to clean and maintain. This commercial square Belgian waffle maker will serve you over the years with proper upkeep. ✪ SIMPLE OPERATIONS: There is no particular training needed to start using this manual Belgian Waffle maker immediately. All the operations are simple and understandable. Start the machine with an on/off switch on the front panel, turn a temperature control knob clockwise to adjust the desired heat level, and set the cooking time with a timer knob. One big round-shaped crunchy waffle will be ready to serve in a few minutes. ✪ NONSTICK COATING: The baking plates are made of cast aluminum with a nonstick top. The nonstick coating prevents the dough from sticking and burning. The plates are highly conductive and warm fast and evenly, providing uniform heating. As a result, your waffles obtain a beautiful golden-brown color that makes them look so appetizing! To keep the plate clean, just wipe it with a damp rag after use. ✪ 100% GUARANTEED QUALITY: Great customer support with a flexible return policy and a money-back guarantee. Your satisfaction is our main priority, that is why we are constantly improving our service and value any feedback. We are always available for any questions and concerns you might have. We provide warranty and after-sale service support to make sure you are fully satisfied with your experience and our product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oDHbvXAJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALDKitchen","source_asin":"B07H483XLK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H483XLK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H483XLK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
