window.products.push({"id":956092,"name":"FOMI Premium Large Water Sleeping Pillow | Adjustable and Supportive Waterbase Pillow for Preferred Firmness | Orthopedic Comfort Design for Neck Pain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NidO3BN-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOMI's Water Pillow will ensure that you get a good night’s sleep to rest, recover and prepare for the next day. Its outer layer of high-count cotton threading gives a soft, smooth, hotel quality feel that stays cool and comfortable all night. The inner layer of soft, fluffy polyester fiber provides maximum comfort. Finally, the water layer ensures that the pillow maintains its shape as well as instantly adjusts to your head movement, providing the ultimate, long-term, responsive support for the head and neck. This not only improves the quality of your sleep, it minimizes sleep interruptions.Clinical trials found that water pillows reduce morning pain intensity, increase pain relief, and improve quality of sleep. FOMI's Water Pillow is designed to support your head, neck, and upper back, preventing strain and injury. It allows the head and shoulders to be at a more comfortable and natural level and posture, relieving neck/cervical pain and swelling related to pinched nerves, neck strain or injury, herniated disc, degenerative disc disease, stiff neck, headaches. .The pillow can be easily adjustable to your personal preference. It can be soft, medium, or firm. Simply add more water for a firmer pillow, and less water for a softer one. For a softer feel, add about 70 oz of water. For a medium feel, add about 90 oz water. For a firm feel, add about 120 oz water. Then push your hands down on the bottom of the pillow to remove air pockets. Finally, screw the valve into the opening. IMPORTANT - In order to prevent leaking, please make sure to use the bottom of the funnel that comes along with the product to tighten the valve as much as possible.At 26\"X 17\", FOMI's Water Pillow accommodates back, side or stomach sleepers, as well as pregnant women who want added stomach support that is soothing but won't create pressure when they move.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NidO3BN-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FOMI","source_asin":"B0788FSNG7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0788FSNG7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0788FSNG7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":956093,"name":"Crystal Cup Co. Insulated Tumbler w/Lid and Straw, Insulated Cup Travel Mug, Stainless Steel Tumblers with Straw, 40 oz. Tumbler w/Handle, Insulated C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6110l8eV0KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The name of our company, Crystal Cup Co., was encouraged by our life-changing whitewater rafting trip down the Grand Canyon. The spectacular views and beautifully colored landscape recognize the Grand Canyon as one of the natural wonders of the world. Our experience provided us with an unforgettable adventure. We were influenced by Crystal Rapid, one of the most technically difficult rapids on the entire Colorado River. It was created by the convergence of Slate Creek and Crystal Creek, well-known for its clear and crystal-like water. This significant Grand Canyon rapid is respected and appreciated by river rafters. Our whitewater rafting trip down the Grand Canyon and the respected Crystal Rapid, inspired a brand that creates products to accompany you during your life-changing experiences. Crystal Cup Co. was created in 2021 with the launch of our, On the Go 40 oz Tumbler. Whatever you do to keep busy and stay active, we stand by our On the Go 40 oz Tumbler to conveniently keep you hydrated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6110l8eV0KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystal Cup Co.","source_asin":"B0BB9KLQ1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB9KLQ1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB9KLQ1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
