window.products.push({"id":956126,"name":"Decorative tapestry art wall hanging bedroom living room dormitory TV background wall blanket 60 X 51 inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xjTLNo-SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Living room decoration: Colorful art tapestries, vibrant and bright designs, simple and colorful decorations add a touch of color to your life. The unique tapestries are very suitable for hanging in your living room and bedroom to add vitality to the family. This is a great gift! Decorative tapestries can be hung in the living room, bedroom, bar, office, etc. Durable fabric: Quality is very important. Our national flag will not be easily damaged even in stormy weather. It is strong enough. The high-quality polyester fiber guarantees bright colors, not to mention that the colors are affected by ultraviolet rays. Whether it is autumn, winter, spring or summer, our tapestry is a perfect decoration, worthy of your trust. Package includ: 60*51inch tapestry, equipped with 3 barb clips and 3 non-marking nail hooks. Welcome guests into your home with this gorgeous banner tapestry! The elegant design will make neighbors and friends happy. Each of our tapestries is made of 100% polyester fiber. We combine fade-resistant fabrics with fine stitching to create a three-dimensional effect. Our decorative strips, 3D decorations and bold colors make our products stand out. Our team is committed to bringing you a stylish personality that suits your family and lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xjTLNo-SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAJJAKJH","source_asin":"B08P4RZRRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P4RZRRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P4RZRRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
