window.products.push({"id":956128,"name":"Tall Glass Salt and Pepper Grinder Set of 2 - Sea Salt Mill And Pepper Mills","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZfVAfCjsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"I have a large family and I am the cook of the house. I hate it when I go to season and find the seasoning in my beautiful, modern but small dispensers has run out – you know the type, those solid stainless steel models that look great but you can't see what's in them and they put looks over functionality! That is what is great about these grinders. They are really large so I don't have to re-fill every week with my large family and I can see what's in them before I run out. They are so big I don't need to keep packets in my pantry – I can put a whole pack in the mill and de-clutter at the same time! What's more is that these come with caps and we all know that 90% of chefs recommend fresh spices over dried out stale spices. These caps will keep the pepper fresh and in a humid or steamy kitchen your salt will always grind and run freely.... Then when I serve up I can put these mills on the table and they look good. The hint of stainless steel is a nice modern touch. Everyone in my family has individual preferences and now they can adjust grind to suit. If you want larger pepper grind on your steak have it, if you want a light dusting of salt have it, if you want your sea salt in big crunchy flakes – no problem the adjustable grind takes care of it. If you want good looks and functionality these are the mills for you. Inside Package: » Quantity: 2x » Weight: 1.5lbs » Dimension: 2.5 x 7.9 x 2.5 inch. » Material: Stainless steel, glass & ceramic » Does not include spices or sea salt ✔ Top Quality products. ✔ Genuine customer care. ✔ 30 Day Money Back Guarantee. Ships ONLY from the USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZfVAfCjsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cambasso Ltd","source_asin":"B01E3RVXG0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01E3RVXG0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01E3RVXG0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
