window.products.push({"id":956317,"name":"Nax Caki Large Ice Cube Tray with Lid Pack of 2, Stackable Big Silicone Square Ice Cube Mold for Whiskey Cocktails Bourbon Soups Frozen Treats, BPA Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xGxJcyt4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥃 2 Pack Large Ice Cube Tray With Lid - Comes with set of 2, 6 giant ice cubes per ice mold, 2 inch large per ice cube and shapes square; Perfect to chill cocktails, whiskey, tequila, vodka or other drinks with less dilution. You can also use these ice molds to freeze food in perfect portions, such as soup broth or sauce servings, recipes, baby food storage, meal prep, and portion-controlled meals. 🥃 Stackable & Keep Food Odors Out - Nax Caki silicone ice cube trays for freezer with tight fitting lid that keeps food or ice fresh, which can prevent ice/food from absorbing freezer odors. Furthermore, they stack easily and neatly in the freezer without sticking. 🥃 Slow Melting Big Square Ice Cubes For Long Lasting Chilling - Simply fill with water, soda, herbs, juice, or any customize flavor into the square cavities of the silicone ice tray, put it for a 5-6 hours freezing, you can get 12 perfect large ice cubes from the two trays at one time. which melts slowly to keep your whiskey, Cocktails Bourbon or other mixed drinks cold to the last drop without diluting it. 🥃 Easy Release, BPA Free & Dishwasher Safe - Compared with stiff plastic ice trays, our flexible ice cube mold are made of durable silicone, which is BPA free and dishwahser safe, flexible non-stick silicone material and independent cavity design make it easier to release large ice cubes, Simply get ice cubes out by pushing the bottom without bending or twisting. 🥃 Ideal Gift Choices - Take it a whiskey gift for Men Husband Dad Birthday/Fathers Day Gifts from Daughter Wife Son Kids or friends who likes wine or coffee/tea drinks, or as a Fathers day/Mothers Day/Thanksgiving day/Christamas/Anniversary gifts, you'll find it deserves. 🥃 Upgraded Low Waterline Design To Prevent Overfilling - The volume will increase during freezing, with 4 cross-concave on cavity of square ice cube mold, you'll never overfilling, which make the cubes easier to release.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xGxJcyt4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nax Caki","source_asin":"B0BSFWH7NX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSFWH7NX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSFWH7NX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
