window.products.push({"id":956423,"name":"SZUAH 16 Pack Small Glass Bowls 4 Inch Small Bowls 6.5 OZ Prep Bowls Stackable Glass Bowls Serving Bowls for Dessert, Salad, Dips and Candy Dishes, Di","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sRdIyI3UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality: Made of high quality glass material. Lead free and BPA free, sturdy and durable, microwave safe and dishwasher safe. Its clear allows you to see exactly what you put into each bowl, avoiding confusion, no messy storage. Perfect Size: 4 inch glass bowls, volume capacity: 6.5 ounce(195ml), include 16 pcs small glass bowls. Each bowl fits into your palm for convenient usage, enabling uncluttered & orderly storage. Multi-use: Not only great for measuring ingredients while cooking or baking, but can also serve as individual candy, nut, dishes to put out for your guests, or to serve dessert at home or at an event. Space Saving: The small bowls are stackable and take up a little space in your kitchen. Notification: Although we try our best to pack the item properly, the accident during delivery is unavoidable and unpredictable. So if you receive ones damaged or you are not satisfied, please contact us and we can find a satisfied solution for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sRdIyI3UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SZUAH","source_asin":"B0BKL34V1D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKL34V1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKL34V1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":956424,"name":"Nika's Home Cherry Blossom Soy Candle 12oz Mason Jar Non-Toxic White Soy Handmade, Long Burning 50-60 Hours Highly Scented All Natural, Clean Burning ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719nC3x2wCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% SOY WAX NON-TOXIC CANDLES: We at Nika’s Candle care about the environment and that of your home. We carefully researched the best way to make our candles non-toxic and eco-friendly. Our vegan soy candles are 100% vegan soy wax with a single cotton wick made of natural fibers. Our scented candles are made of plain white soy wax in order to avoid using chemical-based dyes so our soy cherry blossom candles are better for your home environment. HAND POURED IN THE USA: We started as a hobby in a 600 sq. foot apartment and turned into a small business in 2014 with the encouragement of friends and family. Each soy mason jar candle is wicked, hand-poured, and labeled with love. We make daily small batches of our glass mason jar candles in a small shop in Massachusetts to ensure that every candle is perfect. LONG BURNING CANDLES: Nika’s soy candles are single-wick, non-toxic soy candle burns clean and evenly and all the way to the edges, reducing wasted wax. Each of our Nika’s Home long lasting candles has a burn time that lasts between 50-60 hours, so you can enjoy our white candles long-term. To maximize burn time it is best to trim your wick to before candle is lit each time. HIGHLY SCENTED: We also use high-quality fragrance essential oils to ensure strong scented relaxing aromatherapy candles. Our goal is to provide you with premium Cherry Blossom scented candles. Bring HOME the delicate sought out elegance of spring's return. It is a faint almond scent with a touch of lilac, vanilla and rose. NIKA’S HOME SOY CANDLES 100% GUARANTEE: If you are not satisfied for any reason with our Nika’s candles organic soy candles, just let us know and we will refund your purchase! We know it's hard to buy candles online and want to ensure your purchase is worry-free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719nC3x2wCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nika's Home","source_asin":"B07N96XHXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956424","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N96XHXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N96XHXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
