window.products.push({"id":956494,"name":"Premium Bamboo Bathtub Tray Caddy - Waterproof Tablet/Phone Case & Razor Slot - Expandable Bath Tray (up to 44in), Luxury Spa Bathtub Caddy, with Adju","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812Dx0FbLIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STURDY & WATERPROOF - Bathe in luxurious comfort with the quality and craftsmanship of the bamboo bathtub tray. Made from high-end premium bamboo quality, and coated with a layer of lacquer, the bath caddy is waterproof and sustainable. The slip resistant silicone grips will keep it from sliding. GENIUS TABLET DESIGN - Relax while watching a movie on your tablet or phone while knowing that your device is protected! The bath tray has an integrated protective tablet pouch that can be used for your phone as well. Say goodbye to wet, wipe-off screens and enjoy this waterproof case that comes along with your caddy! MULTIFUNCTIONAL - The tray caddy also features a wine glass slot, candle hole, soap holder and spa trays on the sides for towels, snacks and more for you to enjoy a blissful bubble bath. Additionally, it features a razor slot, so that you can have everything you need with you! EXPANDABLE - Compared to most brands caddies, which only extend to 41\", this bath table for tubs extends from 29.5\" to 44\", making it compatible with all bathtubs, even very wide ones. It works great for tubs by the wall, as the silicone grips prevent sliding even from very narrow ledges. SPA-LIKE BLISS - Set up your bathroom with spa-like vibes and bring on the tranquility. Whether after a long day of work, romantic date night, valentines day, or just to relax with a book or movie, take a sip of wine , relax, and unwind. GIFT IDEA - The bath tub organizer makes a thoughtful and personal gift for any occasion! Honeymoon, holiday, anniversary or a valentine's gift for a spouse, or as a housewarming gift for a friend. MONEY BACK GUARANTEE - We are confident you'll love the design and quality of the bathtub caddy. If you encounter any issues or it does not match your expectations, we offer a 100% refund for your money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812Dx0FbLIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homeify","source_asin":"B0BD63HY6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD63HY6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD63HY6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
