window.products.push({"id":956555,"name":"IKUK Ceramic Inner Thermos fexible Handle, Stainless Steel Vacuum, 18 Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41m15wkEi4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"◎SINGLE-PIECE MOLDED PORCELAIN WITH NO LINING: After long-term usage, the linings in stainless steel containers may erode and release heavy metals into foods and beverages. The IKUK porcelain technology makes safety our priority, avoiding this health hazard through a kiln-fire single-piece molding method that creates no lining. ◎AUTHENTIC PORCELAIN INSTEAD OF THIN CERAMIC COASTING: Hard-white porcelain created from a 1300°C firing process, superior than low-grade ceramic created from a lower temperature (800°C). Much finer than a fragile layer of ceramic spray paint, our authentic hard-paste porcelain ensures that you won’t be consuming any chemicals due to scraps in your bottle. ◎NO LEFTOVER FLAVOR: Porcelain is a natural material less porous than metal. As a result, it would not absorb the taste of your beverage. No matter what drink you have, a simple wash would get rid of all its traces. This solves a major problem with stainless steel bottles: beverages such as herbal drinks and coffee often leave behind a residual taste, affecting the flavor of subsequent beverages. ◎NO QUALITY CHANGE: Porcelain is also a neutral substance and would not cause any chemical reaction with your beverages, be it acidic juice or drinks containing protein such as milk and soymilk. This improves upon another one of stainless steel’s problems: after being in contact with metal for a period of time, chemical reactions can occur, spoiling the quality of the drink and resulting in the growth of germs. ◎NO METAL TASTE: Porcelain is a pure matter, preserving even the subtle flavor of water, whereas water often tastes like metal in a stainless-steel bottle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41m15wkEi4L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IKUK","source_asin":"B07P6NT5WS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P6NT5WS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P6NT5WS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
