window.products.push({"id":956607,"name":"Anhounine Polkadot,Blackout Curtain,Polka Dots Retro Classy Vintage Fabric Pattern Design Style,Patterned Drape for Glass Door,Apple Green Dark Blue J","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KNqWyrR3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Package Include : 2 Panels Construction : 2.75\" pockets are recommended with no greater than a 1.6\" rod for maximum movement. Meterial Type : Made of innovative triple-weaved blackout fabric. Shading Type : Physical Machine Washable Machine Washable in cold water. Low temperature drying and no bleaching. They can even be ironed as and when required to smoothen out wrinkles. Blackout Curtains Block out sunlight and harmful UV rays with this blackout curtain. The room-darkening curtain helps keep a bedroom exceptionally dark - perfect for afternoon naps or morning sleep-ins. In addition to promoting better sleeping conditions, the curtain ensures complete privacy and helps reduce outside noise for a quieter indoor environment. Multipurpose Suitable for Bedroom, living room, infant room, kids room, or other public place. The curtain can also be used in a dining room for creating dramatic ambiance or in a media room or office to minimize glare on TV or computer screens. Even more, it helps protect carpet and upholstery from color fading caused by the sun. Triple Weave Fabric The blackout curtain features 2 panels made of innovative triple-weave 240 GSM polyester fabric, which not only effectively blocks out light, but also functions as an energy-saving barrier, insulating against heat and cold to help keep rooms cooler in the summer and warmer in the winter. Unlike stiff-liner or foam-backed alternatives, the 100% fabric curtain blocks out light, heat, and cold while still being soft and light, elegantly framing windows with a sophisticated drape and ensuring long-lasting, high-quality performance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KNqWyrR3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anhounine","source_asin":"B07GPHXWHD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GPHXWHD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GPHXWHD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
