window.products.push({"id":956624,"name":"42-INCH Evaporative Air Cooler, SKYICE Windowless Portable Air Conditioner for Room w/ 3 Speeds & 4 Modes, Remote, 70°Oscillation & 12H Timer, Freesta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bsit7DUqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️[Multiple Modes Satisfy Your Needs] SKYICE portable air conditioners humidifier feature 4 preset modes (Normal/Nature/Sleep/Cold) & 3 wind speeds (Low/Medium/High) to offer a wide range of use for any activity. Mimic a cool lake breeze with Nature Mode or blow strong wind after jogging at High Speed, with a total of 12 airflow combinations to cool your summer. ❄️[Optimal for Dry Solution] If you are looking for a solution for hot summers in a dry climate, SKYICE offers a windowless room air conditioner that can create a more comfortable indoor environment by evaporating water and adding humidity to the air. This alternative to traditional AC can help combat discomfort caused by dry air during hot summers. Enjoy a comfortable summer in your dry climate with SKYICE! ❄️[Give You an Excuse for Being Lazy] Equipped with a remote control with responsive and extra-long sensing distance, this free-standing evaporative air conditioner provides a \"lazy\" way to adjust your swamp air cooler while lying on the couch or in bed. With easy to understand icon on the remote & panel, it is friendly to seniors who are unfamiliar with smart appliances. ❄️ [42-INCH Optimal Cooling Performance] 42-INCH Evaporative air cooler ensures that distributed evenly in every corner of your room, providing maximum comfort during hot weather. The outstanding cooling capacity of this portable swamp cooler indoor could be a practical tool for beating the hot, and the best choice for those looking for an energy-efficient alternative to traditional ac units. ❄️ [Removable & Washable Structure] Remove the tank and give them a quick flushing, this portable air cooler provides an enhanced experience by capturing cooling air and ensuring optimal performance. This feature keeps the air cooler for home running efficiently without frequent replacement of new one. ❄️ [Large Capacity 1 Gal Water Tank] By simply adding water and ice packs, SKYICE windowless room air conditioner provides 15-18 hours of continuous cooling. With its large water tank capacity, you could enjoy long periods of cooling air without constantly adding water, provides you with the convenience of rapid. ❄️[Wide Oscillation] This swamp cooler air conditioner packs a punch for its compact size and sleek appearance. This oscillating fan with automatic 70°oscillation distributes cool air evenly throughout an estimated 200 square feet of room. Leaving no corner of your room uncooled. ❄️[Easy to Install] No hoses and no windows required. The installation of this 3-in-1 multifunctional air cooler is very simple, use the included screwdriver, tighten the screws and quickly complete the whole operation in less than 1 minute. Plug it in and enjoy the coolness! The base of the water tower fan is about the size of an A4 sheet of paper, and it is sturdy and detachable for easy storage. ❄️[Make You Sleep Like a Baby] Have you ever been woken up by the whirring sound of the ceiling fan at midnight? SKYICE portable air conditioner is a smart solution to make you sleep like a baby. It features an upgraded quiet motor to blow comfortable air flow across the bedroom with less than 39dB of noise. Besides, the 12-Hour preset timer allows you to sleep without any interruptions all night long. ❄️[Cool as An A/C with A Low Bill] When the dog days of summer roll around, an economic personal air cooler is a great helper to keep you calm and sweat-free at home or in your office. This bladeless tower fan produces a gentle breeze to cool down a 250 sq ft room quickly and evenly. Also, it's more eco-friendly and budget-saving to run than an AC. Enjoy your icy summer night with SKYICE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bsit7DUqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKYICE","source_asin":"B0C8919YX1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8919YX1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8919YX1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
