window.products.push({"id":956667,"name":"OTUOER Upgraded Neck Fan, 3 Speeds Strong Wind Neck Coolers for Extremely Hot Weather, 4000 mAh High-Capacity Rechargeable Portable Fan for Sport, Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kZUmYMz8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【360°Surround Up and Down Cooling】It's like a AC on your neck. 12pcs twin-turbine fan blades equipped with 8300 rpm high speed motor and 66 annular wind outlets, our neck fan not only blows on your face but also the back of your neck! Compared with other neck fan, it is even more surprising that it can blow down to keep your whole body constant cooling relief. Thermally conductive aluminum plate on the top of the fans cool the back of your neck to refresh your entire body in seconds. 【4H Charging Makes 10H Cooling】Our portable fan use a 4000 mAh high-capacity concentrated lithium battery, this allows us to increase the battery life by 4 times in the same capacity battery. It can be used for 10 hours under the premise of low-speed blowing, and 3 hours with high wind speed. Equipped with Type-C charging port, which greatly reduces charging time and easy to use. 【Whisper Quite】This portable neck fans adopt active noise reduction motor and advanced air duct noise reduction design. It’s fairly quite on low and medium but does make some noise on high. Just like your car AC when you turn it on high it makes a fair amount of blowing noise, and this thing can blow a lot of air on high so it does make a little noise. 【Fashionable and Lightweight】They looked like headphone and not a neck fan. Fashion style makes you look so cool, free up your hands when walking, traveling, and outdoor activities. What’s more, as low as 6.7 oz, its lightweight design won't make you feel uncomfortable or tied when you hang the fan for a long time. 【Ideal Gift & 100% Satisfied】We have prepared high-quality and beautiful boxes, imagine how happy your beloved one receive this wonderful gift. Committed to your satisfaction, we offer 30-day no reason refund 180-days warranty and lifetime customer service. If you have any problems with our product, please feel free to contact and we will solve it for you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kZUmYMz8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTUOER","source_asin":"B09VBJBHF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VBJBHF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VBJBHF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
