window.products.push({"id":956870,"name":"Mixbeauty Cervical Pillow Contour Memory Foam Pillow, Neck Support Orthopedic Ergonomic Pillow Side Sleeper with Adjustable Height Removable Pads","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MiobPzo7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-quality Memory Foam ❤【You May Need to Adapt】-This pillow is soft but firmer than cotton pillow. Overuse immediately may increase neck pain. Don’t worry, this is normal. It may take two weeks for you to get used to it. Alternate Mixbeauty Pillow and current pillow while body adjusts. NOTE: The pillow comes with a vacuum-sealed package. The foam pillow and two removable pads are filled in one pillowcase. Please put it in a ventilated place after opening the package and wait a few hours for it to be naturally fluffy. ❤【All-round Support to Relieve Pressure】-The contour pillow supports at least 7 areas including the head to the wrist in an all-round manner, which evenly disperse the pressure on the body causing from lying down and working for long time, to achieve maximum relaxation! ❤【Adjustable Height】-With two removable pads that have different size, the pillow can be adjusted to different heights, allowing you to find the most suitable heights and enjoy a comfortable experience. A package includes a pillow with two removable pads and a suitable pillowcase that is suitable for different heights of pillows. ❤【Correct Sleeping Position and Provide Enhanced Cervical Comfort】-There will form a gap between the pillow and neck touch if you sleep with ordinary pillow. The gap will increase the pressure and cause some problems with the cervical spine. Our Mixbeauty pillow will provide a gently lifted to keep your entire body on the same level surface, correcting sleeping positions, making the cervical spine healthier and more comfortable. ❤【High and Low Loft Pillow Design to Reduce Snoring】-Too low pillows cause excessive stretching of the throat muscles and too high pillows lead to respiratory tract bend inside, both will make snoring worse. Our pillow's design of supporting radian is based on cervical spine curve of 90% people. The high part supports your neck while the low part perfectly withstands the weight from the head.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MiobPzo7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mixbeauty","source_asin":"B0831MC6KX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-956870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0831MC6KX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0831MC6KX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
